      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DROMIO OF SYRACUSE.\nNot that Adam that kept the paradise, but that Adam that keeps the prison; he that goes in the calf’s skin that was killed for the Prodigal; he that came behind you, sir, like an evil angel, and bid you forsake your liberty.",
