      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DROMIO OF SYRACUSE.\nAy, sir, the sergeant of the band; he that brings any man to answer it that breaks his band; one that thinks a man always going to bed, and says, “God give you good rest.”",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
