      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DROMIO OF SYRACUSE.\nWhy, sir, I brought you word an hour since that the bark Expedition put forth tonight, and then were you hindered by the sergeant to tarry for the hoy Delay. Here are the angels that you sent for to deliver you.",
